{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Khitaka","html":"<article id='thag1.104'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.104 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.104 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekādasamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Eleven </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Khitakattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Khitaka </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Lahuko vata me kāyo, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Hey! My body is light, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Phuṭṭho ca pītisukhena vipulena; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>full of so much rapture and happiness. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tūlamiva eritaṁ mālutena, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>My body feels like it’s floating, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Pilavatīva me kāyo”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>like cotton in a gale. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Khitako thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
